@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Maintainer
box "Frontend — Cornerstone workspace" #E0F2FE
participant "Proposed components / tokens" as package
participant "Examples and behavior coverage" as examples
end box
box "Distribution — npm" #FFF4E5
participant Registry
end box
box "Frontend — Companion workspace" #E0F2FE
participant "Composition and lockfile" as app
end box
Maintainer -> package : Implement missing mock proposals L2-033
package -> examples : Exercise exported contracts and failure states
examples --> Maintainer : Behavioral verification evidence
Maintainer -> Registry : Publish compatible release
Registry --> Maintainer : Actual released version
Maintainer -> app : Pin release and remove local proposals
app -> Registry : Install from clean checkout
Registry --> app : Released package
app --> Maintainer : Four-screen acceptance and provenance evidence
note over app : No Cornerstone source checkout required
@enduml
